 "insight": [
  "The share of Luxembourg's exports that were computers decreased from 19.7% in 2005 to 0.8% in 2025.",
  "The median share over the period 2005 to 2025 was 2.2%.",
  "The largest change between consecutive years was between 2009 and 2010, when the share dropped from 24.5% to 7.9%.",
  "The peak share was 28.0% in 2008, after which it steadily declined.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
